  "name": "ocapn.org",
  "description": "Source for the official Object Capability Network (OCapN) website, a documentation and specification hub for secure distributed computing protocols. The project leverages the Haunt static site generator and Guile Scheme to publish technical implementation details, meeting minutes, and architectural papers concerning the Spritely ecosystem. It specifically focuses on formalizing distributed object capability handoffs and interoperability standards for decentralized systems.",
